</style><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s0"></div><div style="position:absolute; top:65; left:0; width:720; height:389;"><div class="s2"><div class="s1"><p class="s3"><span class="s4"><br></span><span class="s4"><br></span><span class="s4"><br></span><span class="s4"><br></span><span class="s5">Кафедра патологической анатомии</span><span class="s4"><br></span><span class="s6"><br></span><span class="s7">Стромально-сосудистые дистрофии</span><span class="s8"><br></span><span class="s8"><br></span><span class="s8"><br></span><span class="s8"><br></span><span class="s9">профессор кафедры, д. м. н. </span><span class="s8"><br></span><span class="s9">Федоровская </span><span class="s8"><br></span><span class="s9">Надежда Станиславовна</span><span class="s10"><br></span><span class="s10"><br></span><span class="s10"><br></span></p></div></div></div></div><style type="text/css">
